230 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Dear Hiring Manager\054\n\nI am applying for the User Experience Graduate position at CGI\056 I am currently completing an MSc in UX Design at Edinburgh Napier University and expect to finish by mid\055March 2027\056 Prior to my MSc\054 I spent nearly four years at MAPAL\055OS in client\055facing roles across business development and digital learning design\056\n\nAs a Digital Learning Designer\054 I worked directly with enterprise clients including BrewDog\054 Levy UK \046 Ireland and KellyDeli to understand their challenges and develop user\055centred digital learning experiences\056 Much of my role was consultancy\055focused\054 involving requirements gathering\054 stakeholder engagement\054 journey mapping and iterative design\056 My earlier Business Development role also strengthened my ability to communicate with stakeholders and balance user needs with business objectives\056\n\nThrough my MSc\054 I have developed my skills in user research and inclusive design\056 As part of an RSE research project developing a companion robot for young children\054 I have worked alongside engineers\054 conducted user interviews\054 designed surveys and carried out usability testing\056 I have also analysed qualitative and quantitative data to identify insights and inform design decisions\056\n\nI am particularly drawn to CGI\047s Government and Justice team because of the opportunity to use research to improve public services\056 I believe my consultancy experience\054 combined with my research skills and interest in accessible\054 user\055centred design\054 would allow me to contribute to the team while continuing to develop as a researcher\056\n\nThank you for your time and consideration\056 I look forward to hearing from you\056\n\nKind regards\054\050Hugh Kelly)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 231 0 R
     /Pg 228 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

